    iommu: qcom_iommu: Add the MSM8226 VFE configuration
    
    Original integration rationale and historical observations follow. These
    observations do not qualify hardware on this refreshed base.
    
    Add the MSM8226 camera SMMU with the prefetch (BFB) values of its vendor
    vfe_iommu description. Like the MDP and GPU instances it halts while
    context banks are programmed and restores them after power collapse.
    
    Original integration AI credit: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>.
    
    Refreshed from integration source
    669336246d0da8ff0b80513c3bef847de98c4d44. Current-base adaptation and
    host qualification used OpenAI Codex. Human review and new DCO
    certification remain pending.

